# No AI markers in product text

User-facing copy (i18n, SEO, articles, UI, changelog, legal shown to users) must not read as LLM output.

## Hard ban: long dashes

Never use `—` (em dash, U+2014) or `–` (en dash, U+2013).

| Bad | Good |
|-----|------|
| `Repdraft — дневник` | `Repdraft - дневник` or `Repdraft: дневник` |
| `21–27 сент.` | `21-27 сент.` |
| empty placeholder `—` | `-` |

Same for agent replies, PR/commit text, and new comments in this repo.

## Other AI tells (avoid)

- Filler verbs: elevate, seamless, unleash, empower, delightful, robust (as fluff)
- Mock-poetic labels, performative micro-copy
- Em-dash as punctuation habit in every sentence

Prefer short gym-plain language. Empty UI placeholders: hyphen `-`.

## Scope

- **Always** for new or edited strings in `src/lib/i18n/messages.ts`, SEO meta, articles, changelog.
- Do not mass-rewrite unrelated files unless the user asks to clean dashes.
